abstract: >-
  Replication package for the Energy Policy manuscript on India's PM-KUSUM
  solar irrigation programme: state-year panel, scripts (p3_00–p3_15), and
  result tables for TWFE, IV, carbon rebound bridge, and confirmatory tests.
